        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "THIS IS A REALLY NICE THREE BEDROOMED SEMI DETACHED RESIDENCE WHICH IS PRESENTED WITH A HGH SPECIFICATION FINISH AND IS IMPECCABLY MAINTAINED.  IN ADDITION NUMBER 8 FEATURES A MOST PLEASANT REAR GARDEN.  RIVERWAY IS VERY WELL LOCATED MID WAY BETWEEN DOUGLAS AND THE CITY CENTRE."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: Under stairs storage. *Guest WC/WHB\r\n\t\r\nSitting Room:  16 x 11.6 (max dimension) Marble fireplace. Gas fire.  Bay window.   \r\n\r\n*Double doors to Breakfast Room.  \r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room:  17.6 x 11.6   Modern fully fitted kitchen. Double oven/hob, microwave etc.   Colourful tiled splashback.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR:\r\n\r\nLanding:\t   Hot-press  \r\n\r\nBedroom (1):    11.6 x 11.2    Slide robe.\r\n*Ensuite bathroom.  Two piece suite.  Shower stand (wired for instant  electric shower).  Extensively tiled.\r\n                  \r\nBedroom (2):    12.2 x 11.6 (max dimension).   Slide robe. \r\n\r\nBedroom (3):\t   8 x 8 Robe\r\n\r\nBathroom:        Fitted two piece suite.  Shower stand with instant electric shower.  Extensively tiled.  Heated towel rail.\r\n                          \r\nOUTSIDE:\r\n\r\nAccess garden to front, lawned and with driveway.  Most pleasant rear garden in lawn and with patio area.  Shed."
